        that jar alone would serve. Below every house jar, so each takes it at test scope; the house's whole instance is
        HouseStyles', above them.
    </description>

    <dependencies>
        <dependency>
            <groupId>io.github.captainssingapura-hue.homing.js</groupId>
            <artifactId>homing-ui-taxonomy</artifactId>
